    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Sections aren’t numbered by default. However, you can enable this feature by setting the attribute "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sectnums"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title\n:sectnums:"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sectnums"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is set, level 1 ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "=="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") through level 3 ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "===="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") section titles are prefixed with arabic numbers in the form of "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "1."
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "1.1."
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", etc. Section numbers can be set and unset via the document header, CLI, and API. Once you’ve set "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sectnums"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", you can reduce or increase the section levels that get numbered in the whole document with the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sectnumlevels attribute"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#numlevels"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". You can also control whether a section is numbered on a section by section basis."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "sectnums"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " attribute is a unique attribute. It’s a "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "flexible attribute"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "strong",
                    "roles": [
                      "term"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ", which means it can be set and unset midstream in a document, even if it is enabled through the API or CLI. This allows you to toggle numbering on and off throughout a document."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "To turn off numbering for one or more sections, insert the attribute above the section where you want numbering to cease and unset it by adding an exclamation point to the end of its name. To turn section numbering back on midstream, reset the attribute above the section where numbering should resume."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "listing",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "= Title\n:sectnums:\n\n== Numbered Section\n\n:sectnums!:\n\n== Unnumbered Section\n\n== Unnumbered Section\n\n=== Unnumbered Section\n\n:sectnums:\n\n== Numbered Section"
                  }
                ],
                "language": "asciidoc",
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "For regions of the document where section numbering is turned off, the section numbering will not be incremented. Given the above example, the sections will be numbered as follows:"
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "literal",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "1. Numbered Section\n\nUnnumbered Section\n\nUnnumbered Section\n\nUnnumbered Section\n\n2. Numbered Section"
                  }
                ],
                "language": null,
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The section number does not increment in regions of the document where section numbers are turned off."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "_toggle_section_numbers_on_or_off_per_section",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Toggle section numbers on or off per section"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "If "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "sectnums"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " is set on the command line or API, it overrides the value set in the document header, but it does not prevent the document from toggling the value for regions of the document."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "If it is unset ("
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "sectnums!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ") on the command line or API, then the numbers are disabled regardless of the setting within the document."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
